{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE WHAT COMES NEXT</p><h1>Find My Career</h1><p class="muted">Match diagnostic answers and completed-course results to possible career directions.</p></div></div>
<div class="notice info">Career suggestions use your latest knowledge diagnostic and completed course results. Earned certificates identify course achievements; they do not count as professional licences. Ongoing courses appear as learning options, not earned skills. These are not job offers or employment probabilities.</div>
<section class="card career-finder"><div class="row wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">BSTM LEARNING-ALIGNED PATHWAYS</p><h2>Your career matches</h2></div><a class="button secondary" href="#career-matches">Find My Career Matches ↓</a></div><p class="small muted">Pathways are ranked from predefined BSTM competency rules, your diagnostic answers, latest completed course scores and any completed practical rubrics. The AI explanation is optional; your rule-based matches remain available when no AI provider is configured.</p>
{{#if aiReady}}<details class="space-top"><summary>Get an optional AI explanation</summary><form action="/student/careers/generate" method="post" data-career-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrf}}"><label class="answer"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I agree to share anonymised course titles, progress, assessment scores and award status with Gemini. My name, email and Student ID are excluded.</span></label><button type="submit" class="button secondary space-top">{{> icon name="search"}}Ask AI to explain my matches</button><p class="notice error" data-career-error role="alert" hidden></p>
<div class="career-cloud-search" data-career-loading hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><div class="career-clouds" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="career-magnifier" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/fluent-emoji/magnifying-glass.png" width="70" height="70" alt=""></span><strong>Preparing an optional AI explanation…</strong><p>Your rule-based matches are already available below.</p></div></form></details>{{else}}<p class="small muted space-top">Optional AI explanations are unavailable. Your rule-based career matches still work.</p>{{/if}}
{{#if ai}}<div id="ai-results" class="space-top"><span class="chip">AI career guidance · {{ai.generatedAt}}</span><p class="space-top">{{ai.summary}}</p><div class="grid cols-2 space-top">{{#each ai.matches}}<article class="career-ai-match"><span class="chip">{{label}}</span><h3>{{title}}</h3><p>{{reason}}</p><p class="small"><strong>Next learning step:</strong> {{nextStep}}</p></article>{{/each}}</div><ul class="list-clean">{{#each ai.nextSteps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted">Confirm role-specific qualifications with your faculty adviser.</p></div>{{/if}}</section>
<script src="/js/career-finder.js" defer></script>
<details class="card space-top"><summary>How these recommendations are matched · {{evidenceDate}}</summary><p class="small muted">For each competency, the latest diagnostic score and average score from the latest completed courses are averaged equally when both are available. If every required practical task has a faculty grade, that competency score combines 70% knowledge evidence and 30% rubric evidence. Pathway ordering reflects evidence coverage and strength; it is not an employment probability. Ongoing courses are learning suggestions only.</p>{{#if hasBaseline}}<p class="small">Latest diagnostic answers · {{baselineDate}} · included by competency area.</p>{{/if}}{{#each evidenceSources}}<p class="small">{{title}} · v{{version}} · {{date}} · final assessment {{score}}% · {{areas}} · {{award}}</p>{{else}}<p class="small">No completed courses yet. {{#if hasBaseline}}Your latest knowledge diagnostic is used.{{else}}Take the knowledge diagnostic to establish initial evidence.{{/if}}</p>{{/each}}<a class="small text-link" href="/student/assessment">{{#if hasBaseline}}Update knowledge diagnostic →{{else}}Take knowledge diagnostic →{{/if}}</a></details><div class="section-heading" id="career-matches"><h2>Career matches from your evidence</h2><span class="small muted">Sorted by assessed-area coverage and evidence strength</span></div><div class="grid cols-2 space-top">{{#each tracks}}<article class="card"><div class="row wrap"><span class="chip">{{label}}</span><span class="chip gray">{{assessedAreas}} / {{totalAreas}} areas assessed</span>{{#if preferred}}<span class="chip rose">Related to your interest</span>{{/if}}</div><h2 class="space-top">{{title}}</h2><p class="small muted">{{explanation}}</p><h3>Supporting knowledge areas</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each strengths}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li class="muted">Not enough supporting evidence yet.</li>{{/each}}</ul><h3 class="space-top">Areas to develop or assess</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each gaps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li>Seek practical application and faculty feedback.</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small space-top"><strong>Additional qualifications to verify:</strong> {{#if qualifications}}{{qualifications}}{{else}}Confirm training and employer-specific requirements with faculty.{{/if}}</p><h3 class="space-top">Connected courses</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each relatedCourses}}<li><a class="text-link" href="/student/courses/{{id}}">{{title}}</a> <span class="chip gray">{{learningStatus}}</span></li>{{else}}<li class="muted">No published courses are currently linked to these competency areas.</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted space-top">Verify role-specific qualifications and employer requirements separately.</p></article>{{/each}}</div>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Courses for your next steps</h2><a href="/student/courses">View all →</a></div><div class="grid cols-3">{{#each recommendations}}<article class="card"><span class="chip">{{domain}}</span><h3 class="space-top">{{title}}</h3>{{#if locked}}<span class="chip">Complete prerequisites first</span>{{else}}<span class="chip">Available next step</span>{{/if}}<p class="small muted">{{description}}</p><a class="button secondary" href="/student/courses/{{id}}">Explore course →</a></article>{{else}}<div class="card"><p class="muted">Explore the catalog to reinforce your knowledge and ask faculty about practical learning opportunities.</p></div>{{/each}}</div>
{{> studentBottom}}
